msgid "Blocked devices lose all traffic through this router: Internet, DNS, DHCP and gateway services. Their packets are dropped at every interface."
msgstr "被封禁的设备会失去经过本路由器的全部流量：上网、DNS、DHCP 与网关服务，数据包在所有接口上被丢弃。"

